    <h1>Support</h1>
    <p class="lede narrow">Get help with Compass, report a bug or report a vulnerability.</p>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Ask a question or report a bug</h2>
      <p>Open an issue in <a href="{{ site.compass.url }}/issues">Compass's GitHub issues</a>.</p>
  
      <h2>Report a vulnerability</h2>
      <p>Report it privately with a <a href="{{ site.compass.url }}/security/advisories/new">GitHub security advisory</a>. Do not open a public issue for it. A public issue shows the problem to everyone before a fix exists.</p>
  
      <h2>Supported versions</h2>
      <p>Only the latest release gets security fixes. See the <a href="{{ site.compass.url }}/releases">list of releases</a>.</p>
  
      <h2>Documentation</h2>
      <p>Read the <a href="https://docs.ayeo.io/compass/">Compass documentation</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
